F01 L10 TestIdentityBaseline/A: The original account has Requests=0, Successes=0, and Epoch=7. Call A with the original binding. → Inspect counters before invoking the callback. → Invoke the callback once with the same binding and epoch. => observed-in-code — Admission alone increments original Requests to 1. The callback increments original Successes to 1 and leaves Requests at 1.
