F07 L10 TestIdentitySameEpochReplacement/A: The original account has Requests=0, Successes=0, and Epoch=7. A different account also has Epoch=7. Admit via A. → Rebind the Port target or registry key to the replacement account. → Invoke the outstanding callback. => observed-in-code — The replacement gets one Successes increment. The original has one Requests increment and zero Successes. Replacement Requests stay at zero.
