F09 L20 TestIdentitySameEpochReplacement/C: The original account has Requests=0, Successes=0, and Epoch=7. A different account also has Epoch=7. Admit via C. → Rebind the Port target or registry key to the replacement account. → Invoke the outstanding callback. => observed-in-code — Both Successes counters stay zero. The original retains the request. Replacement Requests stay at zero.
